  "notes": [
    "Nintendo JP Switch spec modal «Joy-Con» (modal/specs/joy-con.html, linked from the Switch 「機能・仕様」 page); one サイズ cell for both halves. Axis mapping as labelled: 縦102mm = height, 横35.9mm = width, 厚さ28.4mm = depth. The modal does not say whether projections are excluded (the console page's footnote that 28.4 mm runs from stick tip to ZL/ZR belongs to the console-with-Joy-Con figure, not to this cell): excludes_projections null. split=rail_halves: the console's レール is 「Joy-Conを取り付けるための溝です。」 and the 取り外しボタン is 「本体からJoy-Conを取り外すときに使用します。」 (feature page). wired=false (Bluetooth 3.0); cell_kind built_in (525mAh, not user-removable); cell_count null. ports [] = unknown (no port row; rail contacts are no contract kind). Control mapping as for the Joy-Con 2: the (L) 上／下／左／右 are four discrete buttons, filed as face_button 4; L/R = bumper 1; ZL/ZR = trigger 1; SL/SR = side_button 2; stick 1; release (取り外し) and sync (シンクロ) counted under button. HD Rumble, NFC and the IR camera (R) have no kind. Runs split by a <br> in the HTML are quoted with the tag removed. released not on the page (null). (L): 約49g; buttons −, capture, release, sync → button 4."
